Upstream: https://github.com/anthropics/defending-code-reference-harness
Forked from revision: d3bea6b5793b5f3d59a75ebe69a58efa88383145

The `harness/`, `dnr_harness/`, `targets/` (excluding Solidity-specific
additions), `.claude/skills/`, `scripts/`, `bin/`, and `docs/` directories
retain their original upstream authorship and are modified in place for
Solidity/Foundry smart-contract security auditing, per upstream's own
documented customization workflow (`.claude/skills/customize/`).

The `contract_security_agent/` package, `docker/Dockerfile.tools`, and the
`examples/` fixtures are original additions, Copyright 2026 Contract
Security Agent contributors, also licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, provided as a standalone one-command audit CLI for arbitrary
Foundry projects, usable independently of the forked harness's fixed-target
model.

This project also integrates with Anthropic's scone-bench
(https://github.com/anthropics/scone-bench, Apache-2.0) as an optional
real-world validation benchmark; see docs/product-plan/ for background.
